<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-043" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-043-guhaozhi" source-id="s-nanqishu-043-guhaozhi-ws2400356">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-043-guhaozhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-043-guhaozhi:p001:m0000" ref="5b7_7xs_ar0">暠之</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-guhaozhi:p001:m0003" ref="5b7_7xs_ar0">士明</persName>。少孤，好學有義行。初舉秀才，歷宦府閤。永明末，爲太子中舍人，兼尚書左丞。隆昌初，爲安西諮議，兼著作，與<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-guhaozhi:p001:m0057" ref="0cf_pqs_mnm">思遠</persName>竝屬文章。建武初，以疾歸家，高宗手詔與<persName id="c-nanqishu-043-guhaozhi:p001:m0078" ref="0cf_pqs_mnm">思遠</persName>曰：「此人殊可惜。」就拜中散大夫。卒，年四十九。</p>
</text>
